Major modifications in this derivative include:

- independent node IDs, custom socket types, frontend extension name, HTTP
  routes and WebSocket event names so it can coexist with AIMixer Director;
- multi-reference Motion Audio Context cursor calculation;
- Motion Context / FL2V start-last keyframe merge;
- exported-frame and exported-audio context semantics;
- frame-exact video/audio trimming and versioned selection-run context cache;
- standard ComfyUI SAMPLER and SIGMAS external sampling mode;
- guarded startup self-tests and compatibility failure reporting.
